L001053	$\forall n=1,\cdots,n_*$.
L001054	Here and below we have set $A_0=0$. Taking inner product with $\ket{\psi_n}=\widetilde{Q}_n\ket{\psi_n}=P_k\ket{\psi_n}$, \begin{align}\label{eq:An=An+1}
